From 744127c9fd91eeb74795d01e70189f7a52ab900f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:19:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Clean up repo and fix small issues

- add .gitignore and stop tracking build output, .gradle and local.properties
- remove debugging dumps (window.xml, output*.txt)
- drop the unused screenshot capability from the accessibility config
- fix the stale service name in the tile toast
- remove the per-scan log line
- Prayers page no longer re-asks for location permission every time it opens
- write a real README
