-# eyzy
+# eyzy (swizy)
+
+Android app (Kotlin, no dependencies) with three tools:
+
+- **Lowery** - an accessibility service that covers avatar pictures in WhatsApp, Telegram and LinkedIn
+  with a continuous vertical line (or optional circles). Toggle it from the app or the
+  "Hide avatars" Quick Settings tile.
+- **Sibha** - tap counter with an optional beep and vibration every N counts.
+- **Prayers** - daily prayer times from aladhan.com (GPS or manual coordinates), cached for offline use.
+
+## Build
+
+    ./gradlew assembleDebug
+    adb install -r app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
+
+Needs JDK 17 and an Android SDK (`sdk.dir` in `local.properties`, which is not tracked).
+After installing, enable **swizy** under Settings > Accessibility.
